          { name: "Aluminum Charge Pipe Upgrade", description: "Replacing the incredibly fragile factory plastic charge pipe (which runs from the intercooler to the throttle body) with a mandrel-bent aluminum pipe.", benefit: "CRITICAL IF TUNED. The factory plastic pipe frequently explodes under boost, leaving the car stranded in limp mode." }
