          "Swirl Flap Binding: Severe carbon sludge inside the intake manifold causes the plastic swirl flaps to bind, throwing the engine into severe limp mode.",
          "Drivetrain Damage (Engine Mounts): Neglecting collapsed fluid-filled engine mounts allows the violent diesel vibrations to transfer into the chassis and transmission, accelerating wear."
