          { stage: "Stage 2 (DPF/EGR/SCR Delete & Tune)", power: "430 - 450 hp", notes: "Requires mapping out the emissions systems and deleting the highly restrictive DPF and AdBlue systems, installing a straight-through downpipe, and an aggressive custom tune. The engine handles this power easily, but it renders the car non-road legal in most areas. Combined with the Akrapovic exhaust, it produces a phenomenal straight-six diesel sound.", zeroToHundred: "4.0s", hundredToTwoHundred: "10.5s" }
